  "description": "VideoDB turns raw video into a searchable, editable database. Connect your VideoDB account and Claude can upload videos from any public URL, transcribe and index them, semantically search for exact moments across your whole library, ask questions and get answers with sources, pull timestamped transcripts, cut clips and stitch highlight reels without re-encoding, burn in subtitles, reframe for vertical, and hand back instantly streamable links you can watch or share. Live RTSP feeds get the same treatment in real time, with continuous indexing and event alerts. Built for creators, media teams, and developers building video-native workflows.",
